d Delivery Contract</span><span style='display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden;font-size:2.6cqw;line-height:1.3;color:#64748b'>Implement graph-native Event declarations, Occurrences, Subscriptions, Deliveries, and handler reactions in a bounded first slice.</span></span></a><a href='github://mikemartinez1974/public/tasks/first-ten-minutes/root.node' style='display:flex;gap:2.2cqw;align-items:flex-start;box-sizing:border-box;height:14.2cqw;padding:1.6cqw 2.1cqw;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:2.4cqw;background:#f8fafc;text-decoration:none;color:inherit;min-width:0;overflow:hidden'><span style='flex:none;width:6.2cqw;height:6.2cqw;border-radius:1.6cqw;background:#b91c1c22;color:#b91c1c;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:600;font-size:3cqw'>F</span><span style='min-width:0'><span style='display:block;font-weight:600;font-size:2.9cqw;line-height:1.25;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;color:#0f172a'>First ten minutes</span><span style='display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden;font-size:2.6cqw;line-height:1.3;color:#64748b'>The tutorial path: a newcomer starts with their AI and sees their own work in a graph. One task for each step, what was found when it was tried, and the questions that decide what to build.</span></span></a><a href='github://mikemartinez1974/public/tasks/graph-scoped-skills/root.node' style='display:flex;gap:2.2cqw;align-items:flex-start;box-sizing:border-box;height:14.2cqw;padding:1.6cqw 2.1cqw;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:2.4cqw;background:#f8fafc;text-decoration:none;color:inherit;min-width:0;overflow:hidden'><span style='flex:none;width:6.2cqw;height:6.2cqw;border-radius:1.6cqw;background:#6d28d922;color:#6d28d9;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:600;font-size:3cqw'>G</span><span style='min-width:0'><span style='display:block;font-weight:600;font-size:2.9cqw;line-height:1.25;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;color:#0f172a'>Graph-Scoped Skills</span><span style='display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden;font-size:2.6cqw;line-height:1.3;color:#64748b'>Plan safe discovery and contextual activation of graph-declared skill packages.</span></span></a><a href='github://mikemartinez1974/public/tasks/handler-method-failure-policy/root.node' style='display:flex;gap:2.2cqw;align-items:flex-start;box-sizing:border-box;height:14.2cqw;padding:1.6cqw 2.1cqw;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:2.4cqw;background:#f8fafc;text-decoration:none;color:inherit;min-width:0;overflow:hidden'><span style='flex:none;width:6.2cqw;height:6.2cqw;border-radius:1.6cqw;background:#6d28d922;color:#6d28d9;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:600;font-size:3cqw'>M</span><span style='min-width:0'><span style='display:block;font-weight:600;font-size:2.9cqw;line-height:1.25;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;color:#0f172a'>Move Failure Policy to the Handler</span><span style='display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden;font-size:2.6cqw;line-height:1.3;color:#64748b'>Name continue-after-failure as an Event Handler policy and record each Method&#39;s outcome separately.</span></span></a><a href='github://mikemartinez1974/public/tasks/interaction-semantic-zoom-roadmap/root.node' style='display:flex;gap:2.2cqw;align-items:flex-start;box-sizing:border-box;height:14.2cqw;padding:1.6cqw 2.1cqw;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:2.4cqw;background:#f8fafc;text-decoration:none;color:inherit;min-width:0;overflow:hidden'><span style='flex:none;width:6.2cqw;height:6.2cqw;border-radius:1.6cqw;background:#6d28d922;color:#6d28d9;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:600;font-size:3cqw'>I</span><span style='min-width:0'><span style='display:block;font-weight:600;font-size:2.9cqw;li